//   * The health department link is now hardinhealth.org, which the county links;
//     that site currently shows an under-construction notice.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Hardin County KY/TN/TX/IA/IL; Kenton County KY; Kent, Ohio; Ada OK/MN; Alger
//   MI; Dunkirk NY/IN; Forest MS/VA; "Hardin County Habitat for Humanity" is in
//   Elizabethtown KY; hardinchamber.com is the Kentucky chamber.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Kenton, the seat). Villages with sites: Ada, Alger, Dunkirk,
//     Forest and Mount Victory. Ohio Northern University is in Ada.
//   * Five school districts (Ada, Hardin Northern, Kenton City, Ridgemont, Upper
//     Scioto Valley); served by the Midwest Regional ESC; Ohio Hi-Point runs
//     satellite programs at Kenton and Upper Scioto Valley.
//   * The Hardin County Chamber & Business Alliance is also the tourism and
//     economic development office. HHWP Community Action serves Hardin.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * McGuffey, Ridgeway and Patterson villages and the townships: no websites.
//   * Humane society, park district, food pantries, Hardin County Players and Big
//     Brothers Big Sisters: aggregator or Facebook only.
//   * Hometown Stations' Hardin County section returns 404 (the WLIO homepage is
//     listed instead); Lighthouse Behavioral Health's Kenton page returns 404.
//   * Kenton Port Authority, Kenton CIC and the land bank: no websites found.

